  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest restaurant along the path to Residence Inn San Diego Downtown/Bayfront, San Diego, CA starting at Mission Hills Church Park, San Marcos, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.148078 33.148133)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.172031 32.716881)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.148078 33.148133)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.148078 33.148133)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
